君の言う通り
Just as you said

29
00:05:15,108 --> 00:05:18,808
ヨルニニゲタダケ
I just escaped into the night

30
00:05:22,108 --> 00:05:24,408
どこへ行こう
Where shall we go?

31
00:05:26,008 --> 00:05:28,508
どこへ行こう
Where shall we go?

32
00:05:30,008 --> 00:05:33,408
ここに居ようとしてる？
Are you trying to stay here?

33
